Subject: [PATCH] feat: bank account and QR code on invoices

- BillingSettings stores bank name, account name/number and a QR image
- PUT /api/billing-settings/bank-info validates and saves them (blank clears)
- V10 migration adds the columns to interest_rate_configs
- Admin 'Bank & QR' dialog on the utility bills page
- Single and bulk invoices print the details and QR while a bill is unpaid
- Controller tests and unit tests for the validation helpers
